/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  Component: Sodium sulfate (Na2SO4, CAS 7757-82-6) -- CASE-LOCAL.

  Authored for nanofiltran01_dspmde_reference: the 2:1 salt whose
  DIVALENT CO-ION (SO4--) meets a negatively charged pore, the case the
  Donnan exclusion is most selective on.  The catalogue's Na2SO4 record
  carries the solid (thenardite) and its thermochemistry but no ion
  stoichiometry, which the DSPM-DE law needs to decompose the salt; this
  record carries ONLY what the pore model reads.  No thermochemistry:
  nothing here prices an energy.
    MW  142.036 g/mol  (the catalogue record's value)
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

name           Na2SO4;
formula        Na2SO4;
CAS            7757-82-6;
MW             142.036;         // g/mol  (= kg/kmol)

role           nonvolatile;
dissociation   3;               // van't Hoff factor
dissociatesTo  { Na 2; SO4 1; } // ion stoichiometry (formula-like identity)
